    "required_age": "17",
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815150/extras/17cd181823e71ffdc84d2825f938c326.avif?t=1752984673\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an apocalyptic world devastated by radiation, you'll follow the story of Sebastian, a survivor from Buenos Aires who, after hearing rumors of a safe haven, begins his journey to a better place, unaware that radiation and mutants are about to change everything once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on this survival adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815150/extras/a6c008ae43926f927e30a81ffb23daea.avif?t=1752984673\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Explore environments and solve puzzles as you progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Keep an eye on your radiation meter to avoid dangerous areas and be aware of nearby enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Manage your ammunition and resources wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Different types of weapons such as pistols, shotguns, and machine guns to combat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Explore the city of Buenos Aires after the nuclear disaster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Meet other survivors and complete side missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815150/extras/3a031202e821f581d570376127d60002.avif?t=1752984673\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815150/extras/17cd181823e71ffdc84d2825f938c326.avif?t=1752984673\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an apocalyptic world devastated by radiation, you'll follow the story of Sebastian, a survivor from Buenos Aires who, after hearing rumors of a safe haven, begins his journey to a better place, unaware that radiation and mutants are about to change everything once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on this survival adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815150/extras/a6c008ae43926f927e30a81ffb23daea.avif?t=1752984673\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Explore environments and solve puzzles as you progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Keep an eye on your radiation meter to avoid dangerous areas and be aware of nearby enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Manage your ammunition and resources wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Different types of weapons such as pistols, shotguns, and machine guns to combat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Explore the city of Buenos Aires after the nuclear disaster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Meet other survivors and complete side missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815150/extras/3a031202e821f581d570376127d60002.avif?t=1752984673\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
